  m_text: 'A respected doctor from Crystgate, he graduated from medical school with
    the

    highest honors, earning trust of both the village and its surrounding
    settlements. During a

    devastating epidemic his chosen methods of treatment
    led to hundreds of deaths, ultimately

    resulting in the complete extinction
    of the village.'
